  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Nestled in the charming beachside community of Old Florida Cottages, just south of 30A, this beautifully furnished four-bedroom, three-bath retreat offers the perfect blend of coastal comfort and relaxation. Unwind on the spacious porches while taking in breathtaking Gulf sunsets, or take a short stroll to the sugar-white sands via the nearby Gulfview Heights beach access. Prefer to stay close? Enjoy the community pool with family and friends.<br><br>Inside, the first-floor king owner's suite features a private en suite with an oversized shower and direct access to the wraparound porch. This level also includes a second king bedroom and a cozy bunk room, both sharing a well-appointed bath. Upstairs, the open-concept second floor boasts a bright and airy living area, a fully equipped kitchen, and a dining space perfect for gathering. An additional bedroom on this level provides extra comfort.<br><br>For the ultimate beach getaway, the third-floor tower room offers a fun and spacious retreat, sleeping six with two sets of bunks. Whether you're here for sun-soaked beach days or laid-back evenings on the porch, this coastal escape is ready to welcome you!<br><br>YES BEACH Highlights:<br><br>- 5 Minute Walk to the Beach (without crossing the busy Highway)!<br>- Community Pool (Seasonally Heated in Spring) Across the Street!<br>- 4 Adult Bikes<br>- 6-Seater Golf Cart<br>- Beach gear <br>- Fully stocked Kitchen<br>- Pack n Play<br>- Standard (drip-style) & Keurig Coffee Machines<br>- Smart TVs in Every Bedroom (+ Living Room)!<br>- 2 Patios/Balconies with Seating<br>- Propane (provided) Grill<br>- Wireless Internet<br>- Parking for TWO (2) Vehicles in the Driveway<br>- Walking Distance To Local Restaurants<br>- Recently Renovated<br><br>Beach Access: Located approximately 0.3 miles (a 5-min walk) from the Gulfview Heights Public Beach Access.<br><br>Pool Access: Across the street from the community pool, including grills & restrooms!<br><br>Pool is heated for the months of March-April & Thanksgiving.<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements (Sleeps 14):<br><br>First Floor:<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Shared Bathroom with Walk-in Shower <br>- Guest Bedroom: Twin/Twin bunk, Shared Bathroom with Walk-in Shower<br>- Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Ensuite Bathroom with Shower<br><br>Second Floor:<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Shared Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br><br>Third Floor<br>- Bunk Room Two (2) Sets of Bunk Beds, One Twin over Full with twin Trundle and One Twin/Twin, Shared Bathroom with Tub Shower Combo on Second Floor <br><br>PARKING:<br><br>There is enough parking for 2 cars. There is overflow parking in the community on a first come first serve basis.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Yes Beach + Bikes + Pet Friendly + Golf Cart"
        }
